OL,3,AEnglish pupils ahead of rest of UK in
OL,4,Ainternational school tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils in England have outperformed
OL,7,Fthose in Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,8,FWales in international tests sat by
OL,9,Fhundreds of thousands of teenagers
OL,10,Faround the world.
OL,12,FEngland ranked above the other home
OL,13,Fnations in the Programme for
OL,14,FInternational Student Assessment (Pisa)
OL,15,Facross all of reading, science and
OL,16,Fmaths.
OL,18,FHowever the latest Pisa report, which
OL,19,Fis published every three years, also
OL,20,Fwarned of a worldwide decline in
OL,21,Fteenagers' reading skills.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
