OL,3,AEnglish pupils ahead of rest of UK in
OL,4,Ainternational school tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeenagers were losing the skills that
OL,7,F"matter most in the age of AI", such as
OL,8,Fbeing able to critically evaluate
OL,9,Finformation from different sources, it
OL,10,Fsaid.
